# x86 CLIENT desktop — FULL (thick) extras, appended ONLY for --desktop full on a
# client role (on top of packages.list + packages-desktop.list). The opt-in heavier
# desktop per FD-04 (full desktop is opt-in; thin laptop/Chromebook are defaults).
# See docs/CLIENT-IMAGES.md.

# Heavier desktop environment (XFCE) on top of the base openbox/lxpanel session
xfce-base/xfce4-meta
xfce-base/xfce4-session
x11-terms/xfce4-terminal

# A full-featured browser (binary to avoid a multi-hour from-source build)
www-client/firefox-bin

# Modern audio stack (thin profile is ALSA-only)
media-video/pipewire
media-video/wireplumber

# Media + office basics
media-video/vlc
app-arch/file-roller

# Printing
net-print/cups
